  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARM: Democracy Watch 2.0: Empowering Civic Resilience in Armenia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Democracy Watch 2.0 is a joint initiative by CivilNet and the Regional Center for Democracy and Security aimed at strengthening democratic resilience in Armenia ahead of the pivotal 2026 parliamentary elections. Building on its successful first phase, the project will deliver high-quality, non-partisan analysis of Armenia&#x2019;s democratic trajectory, addressing emerging risks such as government overreach, media politicization, and potential external interference.

The goal of the project is to strengthen democratic resilience and civic awareness in Armenia.</narrative>
  </description>
